 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "aimlabs-67902@2.1",
   "gameId": "aimlabs-67902",
   "displayName": "Update 2.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-11-24T16:48:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The 2.0 tagline was simple: You Asked. We Delivered.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "One of the things you've asked for most is an Aimlabs that takes up less space on your drive. With 2.1, we did exactly that. Aimlabs is now just over 7GB, down from more than 20.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30632227/592118aeab58a0d4d1189c918165be5e9d94ae38.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Nothing was removed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To be clear up front: every task, map, and feature is still here. This isn't content getting cut to hit a smaller number. The savings came from optimizing how the game is built and packaged, not from removing anything you play. We did compress some textures and lightmaps, mostly on the VTC maps, but in QA testing the difference was indistinguishable in-game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "2.0 made it possible",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Building on the technical improvements we made in 2.0, 2.1 features a greatly optimized asset layout and build process that let us reduce build size without removing any content that appears in 2.0. That rebuild laid the foundation. 2.1 is where you feel the payoff: a dramatically smaller install, faster downloads, and smoother performance across the board.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In case you missed it in the main 2.1 announcement, this one's worth shouting about. Nearly 13GB back on your drive, same trainer you know, running better than ever.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
